{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8360aa73-7d0f-8fe8-afd4-a8138e01868a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T11:03:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Good morning. Um [pause] this is Walter Tillinghast. I'm calling about my, my recycling bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Tillinghast. What's going on with the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well. [pause] It's gone. I put it out Wednesday night, and Thursday morning it was, it was not there. I think somebody took it, or the truck did, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. So the recycling bin is missing since Thursday morning. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thursday. [pause] And, um, there's another thing. A neighbor, not sure which one, keeps leaving trash bags down at the corner. Just piles them there. Bags of it. Every week or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so bags of trash left at the corner by a neighbor. I can make a note of that too. Is that near your place, or is it a ways down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right at the corner by my building. Where was I. [pause] Oh, the bin. Yes. I would like to request a replacement. How do I do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I can put in a request for a replacement right now. I'll just need your address so we know where to deliver it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Well, I'd rather not say it over the phone. I'm a renter, and, well. I'll just. [pause] Is there another way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Then I can take your name and callback number, and someone from the office can follow up with you to confirm the delivery details. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be fine. My number is four zero one, five five five, zero one nine three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-three. Walter Tillinghast. Replacement recycling bin, and a report of trash bags dumped at the corner. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's right. [pause] Now what was I going to. Oh, the bags. Do you need to know what day they leave them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you know, that helps. Any day you've noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the weekend, I think. Saturday, Sunday. Then they sit there until Monday or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weekends, sitting until early the next week. I've got that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Good. [pause] Say, it's after eleven now. Have you had your lunch yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, Mr. Tillinghast. It's a little early for me. That's kind of you to ask. I'll get something in an hour or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's all right. I just wondered. [pause] So someone will call me about the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Someone from the office will call you at that number, and we'll get the replacement sorted out. In the meantime, I'd hold off putting anything else out in a loose pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Thank you, Lorraine. That's the name, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:03:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Lorraine. You take care, and have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T11:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
